  "short_description": "Your açaí, poke or salad — in a bowl that carries your brand. Full-colour printed paper bowls in four sizes, with or without a clear lid.",
  "description": "Three round bowls and a rectangular salad bowl, all printed in full colour so the artwork wraps the whole outside. Choose the size and whether you need clear lids, then send us your artwork.\n\nServing soup or desserts too? See [printed tubs and soup containers](/takeaway-packaging/tubs-and-soup-containers/). For drinks, see [printed cold cups](/coffee-cups/cold-cups/).\n\nYour digital proof and print plates are included in the price. Final specifications are confirmed with your written quote.",
  "benefits": [
    "Full-colour print",
    "Four bowl sizes",
    "Clear lids available"
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Can I use my own design?",
      "a": "Yes. Share your logo or print-ready artwork when requesting a quote. We will confirm the artwork requirements for your chosen item, and you approve a digital proof before anything is printed."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if my artwork is not ready?",
      "a": "You can request a quote first and share your artwork later. Tell us what you have in mind and we can discuss the next steps."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the prices shown final?",
      "a": "The prices on this page are indicative and exclude VAT, which is added at 20%. Your digital proof and print plates are included, and delivery is free to a single UK mainland address. We confirm everything in a written quote before you commit."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why do lids add so much?",
      "a": "Clear bowl lids are a separate moulded part supplied with every bowl, so they carry their own cost. Choose “With clear lid” to see the price with lids included, or “No lid” if you already have a lid supply."
    },
    {
      "q": "When will my bowls arrive?",
      "a": "As a general guide, allow several weeks from artwork approval to delivery. We will confirm current timing with your quote."
    }
  ],
